{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-03-04 09:30:00', 'title': 'SO ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF APRIL 25, 2022 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF THE SOUTHERN COMPANY SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF THE SOUTHERN COMPANY (NYSE: SO) ("SOUTHERN" OF THE "COMPANY") ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY\'S AUDITOR VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF A CLASS CONSISTING OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED, ACQUIRED, OR OTHERWISE HELD OR SOLD, THE PUBLICLY TRADED SECURITIES OF SOUTHERN BETWEEN MAY 10, 2013 TO FEBRUARY 20, 2020, INCLUSIVE.LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: APRIL 25, 2022 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}